      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "值．等式 $5x^3-x=4x^2$，在集合 $\\left\\{0,1,\\frac{1}{5}\\right\\}$ 上是不是恒",
        "等式？",
        "证明：在所有数的集合上，这个等式不是恒等式．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "738",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "738．在所有数的集合上，下列各式是不是恒等？",
        "а）$n$ 和 $n\\cdot1$；　б）$0+k$ 和 $k$；",
        "в）$x\\cdot0$ 和 $x-x$；　г）$p\\cdot0$ 和 $p$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "739",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "739．下列各式：在他们共同的定义域上是不是恒等？",
        "а）$\\frac{8c^6}{c^{12}}$ 和 $\\frac{8}{c^6}$；　б）$\\frac{5x}{x^4}$ 和 $\\frac{5}{x^3}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "740",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "740．证明：下列各等式在所有数的集合上不是恒等式．",
        "а）$x^2+x^2=x^4$；　б）$a^3\\cdot a^3=a^6$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "741",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "741．把下列各式：变形成为在全部数的集合上和它们恒等",
        "的任何一种式子：",
        "а）$7c^2$；　б）$-15b^6$；　в）$x^3\\cdot x^3$；　г）$x^2+x^2+x^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "742",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "742．先进行恒等变换，然后求出下列各式的值：",
        "а）$37.1x+37.1y$，当 $x=0.98$，$y=0.02$ 时；",
        "б）$40.5a-40.5b$，当 $a=3.97$，$b=0.97$ 时；",
        "в）$\\frac{12a^4}{5a^3}$，当 $a=-25$ 时；",
        "г）$\\frac{2x^4y^5}{x^3y^3}$，当 $x=3$，$y=-4$ 时．"
      ]
    },
